    "perplexity": {
      "description": "In a Fever Dream is a 2026 EP by Haken, released through Inside Out Music and Sony Music, and it arrives as a compact but substantial 26-minute burst of progressive rock and metal. It marks the band’s first new material in several years and showcases their trademark blend of intricate rhythms, polished melodies, and dynamic shifts between heavy riffing and atmospheric passages.\n\nThe five-track set moves from the expansive title track through “Delirium,” “Eclipsed by You,” “Bleeding Sky,” and the closing “Lotus,” balancing technical precision with a more immediate, song-focused approach. Early reception highlighted the EP as a strong continuation of Haken’s modern prog identity, with the release also notable for its streamlined lineup and the involvement of producer/mixer George Lever, giving the record a crisp, contemporary edge.",
